Research To-Do List
Project

Title: Digital Payments, Physical Waste: Assessing the Environmental Footprint of India's UPI Revolution

Goal: Explore the relationship between India's digital payment ecosystem, electronic waste, and sustainable digital governance using reliable data and research.

Phase 1: Research Planning
-{}Finalise the research question.
-{}Define the objectives and scope of the study.
-{}Prepare a research proposal.
-{}Decide on the research methodology.
-{}Identify the limitations of the study.
Phase 2: Literature Review
-{}Read reports on UPI and digital payments in India.
-{}Review research on electronic waste and smartphone lifecycles.
-{}Study the environmental impact of digital infrastructure.
-{}Identify gaps in existing research.
-{}Record useful findings and citations in references.md.
Phase 3: Data Collection
-{}Collect UPI transaction data from NPCI and RBI.
-{}Find official Indian e-waste statistics.
-{}Review government reports and relevant regulations.
-{}Gather research on device repair, reuse, and recycling.
-{}Record the source, publication date, and reporting period for each dataset.
Phase 4: Data Analysis
-{}Organise the collected data.
-{}Check data quality and consistency.
-{}Create charts to illustrate relevant trends.
-{}Investigate possible relationships between digital payment adoption and device usage.
-{}Distinguish correlation from causation.
-{}Document findings, uncertainties, and limitations.
Phase 5: Policy Review
-{}Review India's E-Waste Management Rules.
-{}Examine Extended Producer Responsibility requirements.
-{}Explore repair, refurbishment, and recycling initiatives.
-{}Identify gaps in implementation and policy.
-{}Develop practical, evidence-based recommendations.
Phase 6: Research Paper
-{}Write the introduction and research problem.
-{}Complete the literature review.
-{}Explain the methodology.
-{}Present the findings and discussion.
-{}Write the conclusion.
-{}Add policy recommendations.
-{}Verify all citations and references.
-{}Proofread and finalise the paper.
Phase 7: GitHub Documentation
-{}Keep the README updated.
-{}Maintain references.md.
-{}Document datasets and their sources.
-{}Upload charts and analysis files where relevant.
-{}Record meaningful project milestones.
-{}Publish a summary of the final findings.
